  "body": "Positioned just a short walk from Madills Farm Reserve, this beautifully presented Mid-century character home offers an exceptional combination of space, flexibility and effortless family living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for predominantly single level living, the 224m² home centres around generous open plan living and dining, with north facing entertaining areas capturing excellent natural light. Bifold doors create indoor outdoor flow to the expansive deck and garden, providing plenty of space for children, pets and entertaining.\r\n\r\nBeautiful original timber flooring brings warmth and character throughout, while the versatile layout includes two living areas and a downstairs rumpus room, offering flexibility for a home business or additional storage.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Two versatile living areas, with potential for a fifth bedroom\r\n• 224m² home on a Freehold 882m² site\r\n• Single level living\r\n• Expansive lawn with room for a pool\r\n• Downstairs rumpus room, home business or additional storage\r\n• Beautiful original timber flooring throughout\r\n• Fully fenced for security and privacy\r\n• Off-street parking for six cars\r\n• Zoned for Selwyn College, St Thomas School, St Ignatius and Baradene College",
